[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414035146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719#issuecomment-3414035146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111719","id":3414035146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LfgrK","user":{"login":"tetralyte","id":230488058,"node_id":"U_kgDODbz3-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230488058?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte","html_url":"https://github.com/tetralyte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetralyte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T06:16:19Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T06:45:23Z","body":"I think I found the problem:\n[An issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110813) was raised a few weeks ago about root motion not reversing direction in ping-pong mode, resulting in [this fix](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110982)\n\nI'm really not across the code-base, but in `scene/animation/animation_blend_tree.cpp`, changing the new line 271 to:\n\n```cpp\nif (node_backward ? cur_backward : !cur_backward && cur_loop_mode != Animation::LOOP_PINGPONG)\n```\n\nAnd rebuilding the engine 'fixes' at least the pingpong issue for the animation node animation when in Forward mode (it also reverses the animation, not ideal). Play mode in Backward still doesn't ping-pong. This is an ugly hotfix of mine so it's only illustrative and would need to account for the root motion problem. \n\nReverting to:\n\n```\nif (play_mode == PLAY_MODE_FORWARD)\n```\n\nCorrects the ping-pong issue but, again, would conflict with the root motion problem.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414035146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415191297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719#issuecomment-3415191297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111719","id":3415191297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lj68B","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T11:47:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T11:47:57Z","body":"Can you test in [4.6.dev1](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-6-dev-1/), or [build from source](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/engine_details/development/compiling/index.html) to confirm if this is occuring only in 4.5.1\n\nIt happening in 4.5.1 and not 4.5 means it's due to some cheery picked change, might be only part of a fix made it into 4.5.1","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415191297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415399295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719#issuecomment-3415399295","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111719","id":3415399295,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lktt_","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T12:35:11Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T12:35:11Z","body":"I'll test this with 4.6 rn","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.