https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T09:00:49Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T09:00:49Z","body":"> I can't really speak to this as it's not my area\n\nI think the author of the PR should be contacted instead?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418057622/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418065861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719#issuecomment-3418065861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111719","id":3418065861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lu4vF","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T09:05:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T09:05:24Z","body":"@TokageItLab this & another issue [#111737] are both caused by the fix you implemented in [#110982]. Will the animation team handle this or should I draft a possible solution?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418065861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418155119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719#issuecomment-3418155119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111719","id":3418155119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LvOhv","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T10:05:52Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T10:05:52Z","body":"I'll investigate and send a fix as soon as I finish the current task.\n\nSince https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110813 was definitely a bug too, we need a proper fix rather than just a revert. So if someone creates a PR that resolves both issues,  I also can review it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418155119/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418413803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719#issuecomment-3418413803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111719","id":3418413803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LwNrr","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T12:58:12Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T13:16:29Z","body":"@TokageItLab \nThis is some sample pseudocode written by me:\n```\n// determine backwards direction\nbool backwards = node_backward ? cur_backward : !cur_backward;\n\n// Only fix ping-pong behavior here\nif (cur_loop_mode == LOOP_PINGPONG) {\n    // Reverse direction on odd cycles during ping-pong\n    int cycle = floor(current_time / anim_length);\n    bool cycle_is_reverse = (cycle & 1); // avoids using % for speed\n\n    // Flip direction based on ping-pong cycle\n    backwards = cycle_is_reverse;\n}\n\n// then use backwards for stepping\nif (backwards)\n    time -= delta;\nelse\n    time += delta;\n``` \nThis is just pseudocode though, actual implementation may be larger than this. (My ugly hotfix 😉). If this pseudocode is okay, than I can get started on a PR as well.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418413803/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448435403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719#issuecomment-3448435403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111719","id":3448435403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NivLL","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T11:22:11Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T11:22:11Z","body":"I've sent the fixes as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112047. This should resolve everything correctly.\n\nI apologize for not noticing this issue when I checked the fixes. The root motion animation for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110813 MPR was a simple increase, so the reversal was obvious. However, the bone animation was symmetrical, so even when reversed, it remained the same, which is why I didn't notice it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448435403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]